<title>USA: Ithaca CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet Securities.</title>
<headline>Ithaca CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities, Inc., said it won $10.500 million of Ithaca CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.7321 percent.</p>
